# Solar panel: trickles a small amount of energy into its own buffer, no fuel needed. FLAT: a
# 4x4x2 m collider with the panel rendered as a plane on its top face (uniform render scale cannot
# make a flat cube). Spawned origin 1.0 above ground.
Prefab gameSolar
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer baseshapes
		Node Plane
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 1 1 0.6
		Position 0 1 0
		Scale 2
	Component Physics
		Body Static
		ContactEvents true
		Shape Box
		HalfExtents 2 1 2
